XX. Vacat sedes dies 22.</C></R> <R><C N=1 INDENT=15 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT"><COL N="0121C"></COL> 417.</C> <C N=2 INDENT=130 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">Mart.</C> <C N=3 INDENT=245 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">9.</C> <C N=4 INDENT=360 WIDTH=200 ALIGN="LEFT">Electio Zosimi, ejusque ordinatio
