Vacat sedes</C> <C N=5 INDENT=575 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">0</C> <C N=6 INDENT=690 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">0</C> <C N=7 INDENT=805 WIDTH=100 ALIGN="LEFT">12</C> <C N=8 INDENT=920 WIDTH=200 ALIGN="LEFT">Bibl. in Cod.
