VIII Idus  <HI REND="ITALIC">Aprilis, et cessavit episcopatus</HI>  per  <HI REND="ITALIC">dies</HI>  21 <NOTE N="d" TYPE="Notulae Marginales" ANCHORED=Y ED="Fabrottus, Carolus Annibalis" COM="0201" BLOCK="NO"><COL N="0201"></COL> C, 20</NOTE> . <LB></LB></P></DIV1> <DIV1 COM="0201" SECOND="NO"><HEAD COM="0201">XLVI SANCTUS SIXTUS III.
