 <P COM="0455"><HI REND="ITALIC">Num 76, lin.</HI>  1, S. nat. Sardus.  <HI REND="ITALIC">Lin</HI>  1, mens. 6.
d. 27.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin.</HI>  2. Theoderici (M. Theodori.)  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin.</HI>  2 et 3, cal.
 <COL N="0455B"></COL> Decembris (M, Decembrium) usque in. d. 10 Kal.
