 <HI REND="ITALIC">A,</HI>  votaria.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  11, ad proprium rediit thronum.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI> 
12, expositiones confessus est.  <HI REND="ITALIC">B,</HI>  expositiones hic
