 <CAPTION COM="0953"><HI REND="ITALIC">Ex codice Regio, Mazarino et Thuano.</HI></CAPTION> 

 <P COM="0953"><HI REND="ITALIC">Num 170, lin</HI>  2, dies 20. F. Hic fuit vir mitissimus
