 <P COM="1033"><HI REND="ITALIC">Num 194, lin</HI>  1, Hic venerabilis papa sex columnas
onychinas volut concessas sibi ab ep. ex.
duxit in eccl.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  3, sev philopares.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  4, in quibus
