reliquias sanctorum apost.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  10, mart atque virginum
et confess.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  11, in toto o. terr quiescentium.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">lin ead,</HI>  quorum festis vigiliarum atque natalitiorum
per ordinem existentium a mon ter serv quotidie
missas celebrari instit. In can miss.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  14, hoc adi
a sac die.</P> 

 <P COM="1033"><HI REND="ITALIC">Num 195, lin</HI>  1, in tab lap conscribi fecit, et faciens
ibi pergulam.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  2, sp. gravatas aur duas,
alias saxiscas qu. cruces aureas 4; item cruces similes
10, amulas argenteas superauratas pendentes
paria duo, fibulatoria aurea quinque.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  5, c. cruce
