 <P COM="1162"><COL N="1163A"></COL> <HI REND="ITALIC">Num 279, lin</HI>  1, quae can. ind. correctione.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  2
et diaconis ( <HI REND="ITALIC">M</HI>  diaconibus).,  <HI REND="ITALIC">ib.,</HI>  cons. in eod.
c. pr. est, ut ipsi illi si qui presbyteri, aut diaconi
fuerunt, in pristinos honoris sui gradus reverterentur;
et si placabiles f.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  5, ad apost. f. d. adven.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  6, P. vero, ac diaconi.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  7, consistebant h.
