b.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  11, ubi et super arcum,  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  15, in cujus absida.
 <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  18, unc 3.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  19, lib 13, unc 2.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  20,
et duas alias b.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  21, pens simul.  <HI REND="ITALIC">lin</HI>  22, jam
